{"articleNo":"149929","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=149929&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"*2016 신입생 및 편입생 금융학생증 수령 관련* 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.04.14","hit":"2330","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&lt;2016 신입생 및 편입생 금융학생증 수령 관련&gt; 안내</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">오리엔테이션&nbsp;기간 또는 금융학생증 추가신청기간 중 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">각 학부(과)로 제출했거나 금융기관(농협, IBK기업은행)으로 신청한 금융학생증은 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청일자에&nbsp;따라 일괄발급되어 순차적으로 배부되고 있습니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">IBK기업은행 금융학생증</span></span></span></span></span></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">을 신청하신 학생은 발급과 함께</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><strong>수령관련 안내 문자메세지를 개별안내 </strong></font><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">되었으며,</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><strong><u>4월 14일(목) 10시~16시까지</u></strong><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">(1일간)</font></font><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>학생회관 분식당 입구쪽 주차장</strong>에 설치되어 있는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>IBK기업은행 이동점포</strong>에서&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">본인확인후 수령하시면 됩니다.</span>&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">농협 금융학생증</span></span></span></span></span></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">을 신청하신 학생은&nbsp;발급되는대로 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">농협에서 </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#ff00dd\"><strong>수령관련 안내 문자메세지를 개별안내</strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">하고있으</font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">며, </font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">교내 농협(글로벌관 1층)으로&nbsp;직접 내방</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">하셔서 본인확인 후,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">바로 수령하시면 됩니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span><p><img style=\"HEIGHT: 335px; WIDTH: 527px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/b6fd3ada-0d51-41d2-a551-6f5631108fd6.jpg\" width=\"663\" height=\"394\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">* 학생증발급 문의 : 학생복지팀(478-7068)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
